{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17295","headline":"送杜尹赴东都 · 权德舆","name":"送杜尹赴东都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商於留异绩，河洛贺新迁。\n朝选吾公守，时推杜尹贤。\n如纶披凤诏，出匣淬龙泉。\n风雨交中土，簪裾敞别筵。\n清明人比玉，照灼府如莲。\n伫报司州政，徵黄似頴川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}